  "Starting cards as posted under 'Starting (8)': Endor Operations / Imperial Outpost, The Bunker, The Endor DB, Endor, Prepared Defenses, Power Of The Hutt, You Cannot Hide Forever and 'Third Varies'; the seven real cards count toward the 60. 'Third Varies' is the third Effect started with Prepared Defenses (the strategy suggests Imperial Decree or Something Special Planned For Them, both already in the list), so it is not a separate card and is dropped.",
  "No single starting Effect is named (Power Of The Hutt and You Cannot Hide Forever both start), so none is marked as the starting Effect.",
  "Posted 'The Bunker' dested Endor: Bunker (Dark); 'The Endor DB' dested Endor: Landing Platform (Docking Bay) (Dark); Endor, Kashyyyk, Sullust and Kessel dested the Dark printings.",
